Before You charge third parties for access to AnMaCha Cast or a Modified Version as a hosted service, subscription, managed AnMaCha Cast platform, reseller service, white-label service, or materially similar commercial offering, You must obtain a separate written Commercial Hosting License from the Licensor.

The Commercial Hosting License may provide for a revenue share, recurring fee, minimum fee, individually negotiated terms, or another commercial arrangement.

No particular percentage or commercial price is granted or promised by this public license.

This restriction does not by itself prohibit charging for unrelated services or business activities merely because AnMaCha Cast is used internally as a tool. For example, operating a commercial radio station with AnMaCha Cast does not automatically create a revenue-share obligation.

